## The Perfect Setting for Your Camper

Camp Otyokwah offers off-season programs facilitated by our resident staff. Our annual Ignite retreat for students have become a favorite for many campers and students a chance to engage Scripture, explore spiritual disciplines, re-orient their Christian life during the winter months, and have fun building relationships and playing together. Our retreats offer:

- Engaging teaching rooted in Scripture
- Awesome games and winter activities
- A more relaxed pace than summer camp
- Beautiful outdoor surroundings at Camp Otyokwah

