## Rooted Retreat

Rooted is our fall retreat for High School students (grades 9-12). Get away from the busyness of life and experience Christ through worship, teaching, and community in a cozy winter setting.

- Dynamic worship and engaging teaching
- Fall Activities (campfires, hayrides, pumpkin contests)
- Small group discussions
- Warm fellowship and great food

